# Claude Code (agent-local config + worktrees)
# Ignore everything under .claude/ EXCEPT shared skills, which are versioned
# with the code. Re-including a nested path needs the parent dirs unignored
# first — git never descends into an excluded directory.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/mdpubs/

# Syncthing temp files and sync-conflict copies
